1
00:00:00,717 --> 00:00:02,147
'Cause I already know
what he'll say.

2
00:00:02,151 --> 00:00:05,121
(whining voice):
"Wah, wah, wah,
you shouldn't do it."

3
00:00:05,121 --> 00:00:07,421
It's just like he's here!

4
00:00:10,092 --> 00:00:12,062
(Raj:)Okay, so we know
that previous attempts

5
00:00:12,061 --> 00:00:14,291
(Raj:)to send a message into space,
like the Golden Record

6
00:00:14,297 --> 00:00:16,467
on Voyager,
were heavily criticized.

7
00:00:16,466 --> 00:00:18,066
(Leonard:)Well, aliens could only play
the Golden Record

8
00:00:18,067 --> 00:00:20,037
(Leonard:)if they figured out
how to build a record player.

9
00:00:20,036 --> 00:00:23,436
(Raj:)Eh. Although, to be fair,
I watched E.T. build a telephone

10
00:00:23,439 --> 00:00:25,639
(Raj:)out of a Speak & Spell
and an umbrella.

11
00:00:26,842 --> 00:00:29,842
(Raj:)Dude was like
a little brown MacGyver.

12
00:00:29,846 --> 00:00:32,046
(Leonard:)That would be more helpful
if E.T. were real.

13
00:00:32,048 --> 00:00:37,118
(Raj:)Well, my feelings were real
when he was about to die.

14
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:41,560
(Leonard:)My God, when he's on the table
and they use the paddles on him.

15
00:00:41,558 --> 00:00:42,888
(Raj:)And he's all white.

16
00:00:42,892 --> 00:00:44,662
(Leonard:)They zip him up in that bag.

17
00:00:44,661 --> 00:00:47,361
(Raj:)And Gertie can't stop crying.

18
00:00:47,363 --> 00:00:49,163
(Leonard:)The flower dies.

19
00:00:49,165 --> 00:00:51,565
(Raj:)Okay, let's talk
about something else.

20
00:00:51,568 --> 00:00:53,998
All right, all right.
So it-it sounds

21
00:00:54,003 --> 00:00:56,473
(Leonard:)like we need a way
to communicate that's simple.

22
00:00:56,472 --> 00:00:58,402
(Raj:)And doesn't require
outside machinery

23
00:00:58,408 --> 00:00:59,878
(Raj:)to be built to access it.

